  "changes": "Removed `addr_state` from the model inputs for fair-lending and explainability reasons ([amendment 1](../../docs/model_selection.md#amendment-1--remove-addr_state-decided-before-training-v110)). In v1.0.0 it appeared among the top three reason codes for most applicants. Cost on the 2016 test year: AUC 0.6895 \u2192 0.6884 (paired bootstrap difference \u22120.0011, 95% CI \u22120.0018 to \u22120.0004). Lending outcomes are unchanged: at 80% approval the default rate is 12.35% \u2192 12.34% and the realized return is +7.06% in both versions. Fitted models now store their input field list, so later schema changes cannot alter a released model.",
